{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0c89a1ba9ccc23641acef21539e5e8277b2825828a33d61dd8b2d87e65e7daef",
      "source_sha256": "d235c38029b6875d328a4f4c162bc836bb9693275464ca4d7eb0f48d0791b6b8",
      "translation": "听说，修恩扎伊特出现在杜南丘陵，是真的吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8103e09ed5a8cfa98593d018eb94bf5edc3f3494ba681d991d576d5853aa615b",
      "source_sha256": "ae4fbae87f48ab8cee6a4352771f1b184e2032b5436ced30206c27bc94cff044",
      "translation": "要是真的，那可太可惜了。要是当时抓住了那家伙，战争就已经结束了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4be59597db5d4a0a48e69608cc97df081cd3991cd8b7c841aa2c4327ad0cd9ac",
      "source_sha256": "8aaa169e9b97cec88be3d26f12bcc5fa8e39192f777890f556586484ee244431",
      "translation": "听说，北部军新来的敌将很厉害，不过，看来也不怎么样嘛。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cf84802e3c98ba5dabc514c6ce8aa3faa0734f04fe070e26fc0098cf0ea63257",
      "source_sha256": "3520cb37d4de677f483cb9295ec0d34bd43a321951a554cf07a80b752a460525",
      "translation": "攻占老狐峡谷，花了那么长时间，杜南丘陵却一下就拿下了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9ae8013c97e05a8044fecf207aec765252032d6be4ce8b03792f6f77c2b85410",
      "source_sha256": "b6cf07482649027b46eb12e94f26e69f126d294c6d627f8b6b635b732a60f1d8",
      "translation": "现在，只要穿过鲁哈尔特，就是修恩扎伊特所在的贝尔福特了！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0a89b74d96e62f01c9706cee266823be25566f97561870bf1b23d9a2609c2a17",
      "source_sha256": "10ff46ead8e4c4c642f615fea6af87b15c637caae8d9080d4d7d90e8e76681db",
      "translation": "等着吧，北部军的家伙们！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2f6a9a00229ca0fff5c93fdb6410e4011d5d0558cde0fc0bd8a6806819a44fd2",
      "source_sha256": "dfae93f12b40adfa2b0f302b9a487090d5cefb98b487209feb31281bba523524",
      "translation": "杜南丘陵附近，曾有个叫[雷恩波尔特]的村庄，住着一位有名的铁匠。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fdd5c90f78f96232dafb22d4b685b4dd9365d3c0aebedb909e4fe0dfe953d330",
      "source_sha256": "affe2f0df6b4adc79df3a4f94c2196455a75dbad9bbbf53422cc6c667c8fa1dd",
      "translation": "就因为不服从北部的命令，遭到清洗，如今已经变成废墟了……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:075bcf17e3bb758076c9a1a3e81190e456d8e977281dd18ef5ba43493e01580e",
      "source_sha256": "d609d8140c2573850b85fefae3118a53816d357ce103b671bbb3bc8de501f17a",
      "translation": "他们是害怕，有本事的铁匠，投靠南部军吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b0fbd3659bd9f1d7aa5e41df06e42a8ad7a1d59bc5b821c9947efd7ceddb5f27",
      "source_sha256": "4058ffae1c6315c20872071444f789c30da76ded2cb9f294e0510dc8b08aae47",
      "translation": "这么说来……杜南丘陵附近，曾有个叫[雷恩波尔特]的小村庄。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f32218481044f9ded967ccaa75dd90cb26ae1e4f1395b30a5347986fe95ebce0",
      "source_sha256": "4553166ced25512696d0b71f323fd057f6040b6863751cd2f70862cb8bfd245b",
      "translation": "听说，他们长期受到北部军的折磨……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6d77bd27bde2ef25e4b146f1cebe8fba6788c00e69ecf938cfae9a371b827548",
      "source_sha256": "f39d82e810c0a20231944d997938e9597fc72127c5d23ef71f95e1360dc4096f",
      "translation": "杜南平原，长期以来一直是连接兰兹海姆南北的交通要道。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:71988cbeaa580f146ccd54a2734d019b7f0dc9232dcd881623d112b74e08ea8c",
      "source_sha256": "24214294175bb26352b4f3a343a766866d4b3c1365a75196131d3cd8474ee7b0",
      "translation": "所以，平原中央设有休息站，供人歇脚。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a24693dee5b83c1b474739a76e244037a2d49ee3a0104e4af64c7d0dc0372b47",
      "source_sha256": "8c73392156fef4ed28496911bcd60ee49057fa18888f1346a642c20e8040cb2b",
      "translation": "如果有事要往北方去，不妨顺路看看。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6547f06bc5a850794dc0d2ec58e89f7144b604f9e5f2d097dca4332d6c796c6a",
      "source_sha256": "275de1d4a15fca5d41977d20b6c01c1ca2a3b3aaf293dedf44a9105092724668",
      "translation": "穿过杜南丘陵，就能到鲁哈尔特盆地。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:02cc828e29ba62fac879a75ea868a5817fa742ef2b404775f8944c55617f0f8c",
      "source_sha256": "bf50e2f7498e77273b9016d32516ebedbd5e7d100cca56fa3c2fca798760eb0f",
      "translation": "再穿过那里，就是王城贝尔福特了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d016845669bd83f215900ece5a0b57b633b86626bfad28e86bcec74f518d5e4",
      "source_sha256": "28aef8394a1a0581d9d875dea14c4ab8842340be5d5130604e51006159b1c5ef",
      "translation": "真期待，北部那些家伙，在鲁哈尔特还会抵抗到什么地步。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:35a56be094d565e10bccef5bf59d98bb6e8beb9b1511dda2824f3ccbdd523632",
      "source_sha256": "7fe51f2b1b6fb822c0f657c59f7b1c066490d3a38a7eb4d1cd77d0b266f5394f",
      "translation": "既然他们的哨兵，已经失去作用，就没什么好怕的了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a2b8fbd19cdbff9e6c8f056cf383ece92e079e1866bce5c48d0b8636d250f8bc",
      "source_sha256": "4d66e4f54c93cb4b39536ebcc52b6c1a313a9039d63336adeb7878dedab38711",
      "translation": "杜南平原，有一座美丽的[拉诺阿拉]湖。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4d90c3e34fe10358dd1ee4092280bb21578f587f52387c075323f68e97c8e552",
      "source_sha256": "608645c70f53e857a421ac09e5bb056f04bc1e198ce4ecf0865de61ff260fd5c",
      "translation": "湖上还曾有一座宫殿，是斯特拉斯大人的恋人，阿塞莉娜大人居住的地方。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d19cf17e9917023beb9ebef44dfadddfebae18279386609dac5c14a5f221db06",
      "source_sha256": "855523ccefb00b3651a1e8b7ebddda43f4021a4b85ad1981bc73e8a57bd57cae",
      "translation": "不过，到了1000年后的今天，也已经和废墟没什么两样了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5e893a2add92a233b53056676dddfb09c5b90377ec080566dcb662ceec8b788f",
      "source_sha256": "daf7c5e0cc245563b9c59105fc4ae31c0e86fa4b646fba3e7553622df946c32d",
      "translation": "杜南丘陵已经拿下，暂时能喘口气了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e00c85d025a3d88f47b68b210f24c1a46700b35bc9b2a0f952218e5f613f22d9",
      "source_sha256": "d37aa851313ffa3291a1df3c8c90c4570b57aa661068e4583a59ec1303c72cf2",
      "translation": "看来，距离下一次进攻鲁哈尔特，还有些时间。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d92388ff3c25d4e2ec4204875a55385e20dd653d527c9b675b175ed2ff61edec",
      "source_sha256": "9d92db5d4a18c6569aea55a9e84393caad18a8dc1b32a440cdb0a5b0bf8447f5",
      "translation": "不过，谁也不知道，作战命令什么时候会下来。说不定，马上就会召集我们。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5ccffdafbab586430864f715dca4b1a11dce9bb62cda200d3dbc0c06c33491fe",
      "source_sha256": "e7a91032fdbd255572992e75a4611dd488a1db2d2d55fa954784d15a1aceeffa",
      "translation": "别说这种晦气话。我现在，就想倒头大睡。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b6f11d9bf1f2b2027488c20f591c3dd63d64105850ff4c2c050cd448dd4640da",
      "source_sha256": "c20135eb9be0a75ed787fb8a23777f15496c196eafdb305cca09a75c3d0c31de",
      "translation": "哈哈哈，我也一样。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c57b387efefed21a6e1e512c90c7fa3f05d20d3d53ed120f08a0a78d14e463d4",
      "source_sha256": "6729b334db3ade768947b4069ae8552facf433a711b40117474050199b73e6a6",
      "translation": "杜南丘陵的作战，也辛苦各位了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6f637d7279875662f2fba9ef955d3834cfbb99b6037d6b21d45b966f267ece1a",
      "source_sha256": "95dce43c31420a6bf77bb944a7554b9bc15c62a37a3496a0a508ac87b3958e14",
      "translation": "我哪有做什么啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8ff95e3edc32bf63f8c5cd02c99c1aab424afc36372b5971d6ff65c484b550c3",
      "source_sha256": "ce2da9d88dfbe3718e9dab526c67ea146252f7f88de7541f808eca0fe34a4a82",
      "translation": "这次作战，立下最大功劳的，是反哨兵部队。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6a52b81e9122ae348e840fa27b9f4b004c44c26f57359c65e43dc185f28b3fe0",
      "source_sha256": "c0d06497151145a1c7ed69326fe0a2d73801fac464bdaaa3d6cb21253f39b0d8",
      "translation": "是啊，真没想到，他们能有那样的表现。得重新看待他们了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b7bc7194433e46bddbc3ded646afa03e4f137b13472120bffd1b9fd35768a765",
      "source_sha256": "e94de36c51f04f8e5a8db7d2fdf5153fd485bd0cb7b734751dc0fd4d4b83e49a",
      "translation": "毕竟，那是由公主殿下亲自率领的部队。从某种意义上说，也许是理所当然的结果吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d88f897dae9ac542f81bc772688c63776db2560d762054a3ed6a9be29cfa76b0",
      "source_sha256": "bd9ba6e3a49c7595151beb0542c35f3171c20bc91be54a478be5dbdfb771f9c9",
      "translation": "这次作战，你也算是活下来了啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d79246bfd8d62c99cda73259c144071c8a828061212dba684f1a495dc1680ece",
      "source_sha256": "7e93f7525983db6e5bf95fcdd1afdeaa7d06030522e580b185896c03bf6286c3",
      "translation": "你不是说，军旅生涯很倒霉吗？看来，也没那么糟嘛。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:903ea7e1b2f594aeff2bbb62b2509213f2fe0d822a52c3416913fdf4efe003ee",
      "source_sha256": "62bd1b32df2c821908ad572cd69a41417cada8b9afe5d7210110cf64f072318d",
      "translation": "说什么呢！全靠实力，实力！哈哈哈！！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9f5326e02489a1531b633406de6ba037417090392bd42d3b0096cce71ddec133",
      "source_sha256": "11030e41da43b23d9e7828b80545fa4faf984ad6f89d13f43fa5179351b3bccb",
      "translation": "一路连胜！喝吧，喝！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fdeacd2a9db320b618c9e9699d5a2546ff96071bb97c7c44772a369bd596ec1c",
      "source_sha256": "07351c609d912c2ad164c803067ea81bce8d5c4f4f970ee448388d94830299f2",
      "translation": "你这家伙，真是的……唉～"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:216eee0deb0d48a5ce5570ea2575dc2c9f1334a075b18e86fbacb5eda254fe35",
      "source_sha256": "4c0747b17561222b77d59a41d6427aa3e1fd5f8c5e652ce722cef9ba8e1889e6",
      "translation": "不能再这样下去了，我也得找点活干。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:88f5b8ed1e68fcad1467d472d0813b3ec95dd87b6515ebe9dd28a04ac3f2a8f3",
      "source_sha256": "61f22d3f937e2f46bfd40f4b35a67993f50340b6dd8a9441ee7740825392e118",
      "translation": "连明天吃的面包，都没着落。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:53c0484b410e505bff9839ef0ab6c20392437a860f13c42b5867db0b576de172",
      "source_sha256": "0ab26d8050134ecb9c528e12aebd39e80b652156a7f8a9f58910b19a552194d8",
      "translation": "下一个，就是鲁哈尔特。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:55058ec1e88c826a1365073c1980c9103883ce4dad475e17ae3887791a47f3a6",
      "source_sha256": "34a56d2234d1add87962255645070243e2886c9cbab4000c8de345124280ff6e",
      "translation": "给那些嚣张的北部军，一点颜色瞧瞧！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9bfea3fdf37bc8ee6299344a29a5f7e69a448961f667192de272c97f7f7c192e",
      "source_sha256": "4ec3818f6ac8c0b32a8a8af900108edeaefad3bb22e465cf39234e82efb5bbc0",
      "translation": "得休息一下了。最近，好像太勉强自己了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:83f2865ab27471bba6107d407d6c5747e10bfac490050ffae0dfed99f50bebca",
      "source_sha256": "7b0243995e26d79b56515a4842e89644fe2567a3a6f7e015d641901b8bff493c",
      "translation": "伤口一直都好不了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1d98025695e8aa4255854e93c89a7dd01eec1a1f56e27db5c4d7e63ff65ec176",
      "source_sha256": "111bb6635fcfa847df9c659343344e20d6b744878e50b408087eb047a8fbcd04",
      "translation": "我听到的传闻是这样的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cf746dbbe5d7d1890c23ad3c1f38bbf283ffcef861fd2e3e394e5138e701efa5",
      "source_sha256": "125d94a1b352c3f11a7dafda8e8f6c0b48e11d18f948424584d275660385cbd9",
      "translation": "北部军似乎，正在从风息岛撤退。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:761e5080040d987b7a9d2bb7936844f4a84c923e0a3aff6ca73d089b2e90460b",
      "source_sha256": "189274d538a7a2d03e9d7d8fe33a3c63402c224821fa7b632043257881fedd55",
      "translation": "看来，他们的兵力，也渐渐不够用了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:66ac5fb3d10594132ed52a2ba04527f7091c27f3cbdfd4e97bd60ff9dc1e55c9",
      "source_sha256": "8592b46800cef6482955e2ae3aa70088975f8333c263f69e123ee2b7ac92fdf7",
      "translation": "连杜南丘陵也……！再这样下去……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4f5c154221f69565e878a2f38418ed7ee9ff891e3d9a236f743866d947d8541e",
      "source_sha256": "795e21adaea9ea8ffce4d610582e095ebde11f3be0e8fcaa7fac00ba511810bc",
      "translation": "听说，连杜南丘陵都拿下了。加油啊！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:72e51d78bea64667ccf2714a3b4dfffff91be30236b2f3c2a4527537f48060ee",
      "source_sha256": "9640d2815df989e40a178f04097ae942f70adba1545c1cb4c9acd8d35c9abf98",
      "translation": "听说，各位在攻占杜南丘陵时，也立下了大功。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:11b23d961ac80da9855e0ff9a8214e3060b45d0a5bd26b45bdc72b746f325c8e",
      "source_sha256": "e31745090cd67f0d37cd22a2660993bbdae8c00731bd2a04cd3ef4fc107952b2",
      "translation": "真是辛苦各位了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:acb51710221ac97b9c6ede0fad198da42d07dfd4e00e47b6ce59406ea066b9f3",
      "source_sha256": "22d08a86e9488fec998a00a6d4c543012e9abd79c885204fb1d6cfbdf82ee4df",
      "translation": "看来，接下来会有些忙了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9fd2aafd391745f64d3fefccca4bf25eb54cf0bbeb1e90006c0bf326301e723d",
      "source_sha256": "5ed75f09ce241ae4ce8b7f035ca42db492ef50b28961008522db8fbb9638cb06",
      "translation": "毕竟，黑刃要塞也得守卫啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:423a23eacf1eacc0a21bba0172be99a2350e647f900a1bd68aed75befdff3065",
      "source_sha256": "26903155454b2c973d4ba2caf063e283c36faaf0448986b7197e50a8a17b0d22",
      "translation": "呜呜……求你一定要平安回来……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4920b978f6eb85cd192d567468c649c23efe3756bcb9f027faf8b62a6295fbc8",
      "source_sha256": "9509d2cad55bf52b237a8dddeba5281d22715e43028db0748676105e135d8386",
      "translation": "虽然已经攻占峡谷，但还有北部军残党留下，请务必小心。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ea0bd07028172fd371184c4d164da1dfcc316a1c127820d4eac97bad0ee9bd3a",
      "source_sha256": "12bac32c9d47762253cceaa647763dde40ab60a7a90cc319dff4f777044e7d98",
      "translation": "北部军那些家伙，真是顽固……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3a3950bf06b3529f084cbbb6a3445109c1338fd7d4d490f4b64180f8e6e97119",
      "source_sha256": "8d22a5b0195d53ed8bec36ade656b9e9ce2bb17b37e112ed8f35e52ad3e97a2b",
      "translation": "如今，率领北部军残党的，是一名叫泽格隆的北部军军官。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:32916df9a0558df785135f3cb5912dff5e3b3a159caf6dec2b6852481c649f89",
      "source_sha256": "0537f150825e54f68b7481b61bcabedc824d32eca9632de0432448cf6c917612",
      "translation": "和希昂·雷格拉尔一样，是个强敌。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:49ee7348d3dbcf6cf0616c24a5a0996f02d17b324c72b33031a2b89cb557fa0d",
      "source_sha256": "650ecdcabe79071ebe55810cad0bfeb9715dd6ea40d8046d36990a2806737a42",
      "translation": "甚至让人觉得，仿佛希昂·雷格拉尔，活着回来了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8045e39189dbf78da829d0b83ec3b7ab8be42e4cea96636ecd2333af508a5578",
      "source_sha256": "ee0090bfe070629cfe74aa51801c26dd21cdfdea717aa366cae398921eff14f0",
      "translation": "我们本想从四面包围，一举歼灭他们，可是……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:17983cc96fa1e3748263c04efc906950b307dbbc942602ef968cf31a4071bd8e",
      "source_sha256": "1bca8f8b8bdbd895edb204d87a49980fb24dd764f1ea77a9028126449061600a",
      "translation": "说来惭愧，我们惨败给了敌将泽格隆。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:80aadce202cb098babc051a8bf80a1cd0e8299324d5fdb95780985ca208a0a49",
      "source_sha256": "eaddab0fff8100d14991e27a63dd8eb0b7b494129dca848b8f2b8b68cc91cb1a",
      "translation": "实在无颜以对。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bd57c0b828b2271d97ce93161856f1894a1e6bacd76a06778c1d5106099ca24d",
      "source_sha256": "59fc9c290abc2535a8e3410ac7d6c997c7cea9bb0d5fd7f2727a5515a6e3e653",
      "translation": "如果放着不管，敌人的援军，就会从杜南丘陵赶来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:22d2dfdffccaa7e4e661b50984e2ab9ba7fdabb41d993bc5a57536c14b322f70",
      "source_sha256": "579eb2baeed1e9023fd6fca6273f2c1e8ff18a97a8c03b15e8ef28c86a8e1706",
      "translation": "敌人驻扎在，这里以东的地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d4a7d57ef60037d8d8905429a2013934015fcc38e3a1b51567d056e299eef920",
      "source_sha256": "1882f7cff9846134a21a49a2ad46fe16b64d6cca6456b4b0c411276a6a4003eb",
      "translation": "真是一群顽固的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1fbbda85be3aff3ad480668a24047f553c2711ae3d452524a3dd4c6026b42855",
      "source_sha256": "d6ad0de0fdb0b35cc6f6d82bdffb267910bd69bb8757157e7604a717e6dd8ead",
      "translation": "他们怎么会，那么信奉修恩扎伊特……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:65b1c4f1af4c36b9ecc884286b50a2c5c62dd2d3f7021655caac8c4da2e00ed0",
      "source_sha256": "8362b31f5419ffd32d82e6e2973eb242b0ed9ae98271120b23f863e20f2f769a",
      "translation": "真是太不像话了……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cbfa6b8e5ead6b7819cac6f47bc20940633651a382a58dbe930e00cce78af8a2",
      "source_sha256": "e1186dc9ef46df5150264f19b3c6d884ff986f24c1a6ebeeb9ba61c04ac199aa",
      "translation": "明明已经击退了主力，却被残党，折腾成这样……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:22ebbcd8429ec9796998279fcfbac3dd51a4712096d76a316a01d72b896d3dd8",
      "source_sha256": "053aba793960dd4e9656594e3ba786cad2c25854e00196812af372065677126c",
      "translation": "一切为了兰兹海姆！"
    }
  ]
}
